# showcase record output (task showcase:record); committed assets: the site
# hero video (milk-tui.mp4, un-ignored below) and the README clip
# (milk-tui-1200-compressed.gif). Everything else here is a local artifact —
# the 1200 GIF is regenerated by scaling milk-tui.gif, which is itself
# re-derived from milk-tui.mp4 by the record pipeline.
docs/assets/milk-tui.gif
docs/assets/milk-tui-compressed.gif
docs/assets/milk-tui-1200.gif
docs/assets/showcase-*.gif
docs/assets/*.mp4
